{
  "title": "第一次等候",
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "line_id": "L001",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "あ、それ、私のノートです。",
      "zh_CN": "啊，那是我的笔记本。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 2.4,
      "end": 7.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S01",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L002",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "よかった。ベンチに置いてあったから。",
      "zh_CN": "太好了，它落在长椅上。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 19.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S02",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L003",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "気づかなかった。ありがとう。",
      "zh_CN": "我没注意到，谢谢。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 26.4,
      "end": 31.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S03",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L004",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "雨、急に強くなりましたね。",
      "zh_CN": "雨突然下大了。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 38.4,
      "end": 43.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S04",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L005",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "この駅、屋根が少し短いんです。",
      "zh_CN": "这个站的雨棚有点短。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 50.4,
      "end": 55.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S05",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L006",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "じゃあ、こっちに寄ってください。",
      "zh_CN": "那你往这边站一点。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 62.4,
      "end": 67.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S06",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L007",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "助かります。電車、遅れてるのかな。",
      "zh_CN": "帮大忙了。电车晚点了吗？",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 74.4,
      "end": 79.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S07",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L008",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "五分だけ。表示が変わりました。",
      "zh_CN": "只晚五分钟，牌子更新了。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 86.4,
      "end": 91.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S08",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L009",
      "speaker": "female",
      "ja": "五分なら、ちょうどいいかも。",
      "zh_CN": "五分钟的话，倒也刚好。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 98.4,
      "end": 103.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S09",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "L010",
      "speaker": "male",
      "ja": "あ、来ましたね。",
      "zh_CN": "啊，车来了。",
      "emotion": "natural",
      "subtext": "restrained",
      "start": 110.4,
      "end": 115.2,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot_id": "S10",
      "meaning_check": "pending_human_review"
    }
  ],
